      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Absolutely, here's a 4-week linear progression strength program focusing on squats, bench press and deadlifts for beginners:\n\nWeeks 1-4:\n\n**Starting Weight**: 65% of your 1RM (1 Repetition Max) for each exercise.\n\n**Week 1:**\n\nDay 1: Squats – 4x8, Bench Press – 3x8, Deadlift – 3x8\n\nDay 2: Rest\n\nDay 3: Squats – 4x8, Bench Press – 3x8, Deadlift – 3x8\n\nDay 4: Rest\n\nDay 5: Squats – 4x8, Bench Press – 3x8, Deadlift – 3x8\n\nWeek 2: Progress Weight to 70% 1RM\n\nWeek 3: Progress Weight to 75% 1RM\n\nWeek 4: Progress Weight to 80% 1RM\n\nRemember to warm up properly before your workouts and cool down afterwards. Good luck, and feel free to adjust as needed based on your progress!",
